# Tray items to recolor to the Omarchy bar foreground, one per line.
#
# A name is matched as a lowercased substring of a tray item's id, title or
# tooltip, so "remmina" catches the item whose id is "remmina-icon".
#
# Run ./install.sh --list to see what is currently on your bar.
#
# Only list MONOCHROME icons. A full-color status icon carries meaning in its
# color, and recoloring it to a flat silhouette throws that meaning away.

remmina
lerd
